<title>POLAND: BPH JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 22.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 22.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 22.93 vs   33.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   37.56 vs   52.52</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 60.28 vs   57.83</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	94.39 vs   67.42</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank</p>
<p>Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
